@startuml 无状态会话时序
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowparam false
skinparam shadow false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1F2933
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title 无状态 MCP:无握手,每次请求独立处理

participant "Client (Host)" as C
participant "Instance A" as A
participant "Instance B" as B

== 无握手:请求直达任意实例 ==

C -> A  : tools/call {_meta:{version, client_id, capabilities}, params}
A --> C : result
note right of A
  请求自带能力声明
  无需事先握手
  无 Mcp-Session-Id
end note

== 下一次请求,可落到不同实例 ==

C -> B  : tools/call {_meta:{...}}
B --> C : result
note right of B
  Instance B 从未见过此客户端
  但照样能处理
  因为信息全在请求里
end note

== Serverless 友好:实例即起即灭 ==

note over C, B
  每次请求都是独立的"一次性交易"
  无需保持连接、无需维持会话
  → 天然适配 Lambda / Cloudflare Workers
end note

@enduml
